MIDIServer(8)               System Manager's Manual              MIDIServer(8)

NAME
     MIDIServer – Agent supporting CoreMIDI framework.

DESCRIPTION
     MIDIServer provides a central implementation of the CoreMIDI framework
     API's, loading driver plug-ins and facilitating MIDI I/O between client
     applications and drivers.

 macOS 27.0                     March 1, 2017                   MIDIServer(8)
